<title>USA: Burlington names Shackouls chairman.</title>
<headline>Burlington names Shackouls chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Burlington Resources Inc said Wednesday it named Bobby Shackouls, the company's president and chief executive, to the additional position of chairman.</p>
<p>Shackouls succeeds Thomas O'Leary, who is retiring. O'Leary plans to leave as director of the oil and gas company at the end of the month.</p>
<p>Shackouls joined Burlington in 1993 as executive vice president and chief operating officer.  He was named president and chief executive in 1995, the company said.</p>
</text>
